monster_from:
ZzzCharacter.cpp, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_STONE_GOLEM:

    OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_STONE_GOLEM);
    c = CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_STONE_GOLEM, PositionX, PositionY);

and the name. No Scale line at all, so it keeps CreateObject's 1.0 - the only Noria monster drawn at its model's own size. No Weapon, no BlendMesh, no HiddenMesh, no Level.

